  "description": "Make the most of your Dremel rotary tools by using our innovative & extensive line of rotary accessories and attachments. Whatever your project, we’ve got the perfect solution for you. Dremel accessories fit inside your rotary tool to extend it’s versatility. Whether you’re looking to carve, engrave, cut, sand or grind, there is a Dremel accessory to get the job done with pinpoint precision. That’s why our purpose-built Dremel accessories let you get your project right down to the last detail. Dremel accessories are also color-coded into usage categories to make it easier for you to select the right accessory for your project. Getting started with your Dremel rotary tool has become a whole lot easier. The 8-piece EZ Lock™ Sanding and Polishing Kit offers a variety of buffs, brushes, and a polishing cloth ideal for light sanding, detail cleaning, or polishing materials to a smooth finish making this kit ideal for jewelry-makers, crafters, or model makers. The included accessories feature the EZ Lock accessory system making accessory changes 6X faster than using a standard mandrel. The set also includes a reusable storage case for easy organization of the included bits. Compatible with all Dremel corded and cordless rotary tools. There’s no need to hunt for the right collet, all Dremel rotary accessories feature a 1/8” standard shank.",
